{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a story about death, love, wealth, and saving the world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921960/extras/410f7ad5057b371f725d6d7c7caf2a95.avif?t=1773120436\" width=1560 height=826 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>story\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hero who saved the world, but you were killed by your own bride. Who among the six girls around you would be the mastermind behind the scenes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against mysterious monsters from the unknown, future, and abyss, become a billionaire from scratch, and search for the truth behind events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this all starts with a dream of yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 10 endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 CG images</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game duration of more than 6 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921960/extras/5374f53b54d9fbcf91bd8134e58fef42.avif?t=1773120436\" width=1560 height=827 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u84dd\u6d77\u516d\u91cd\u594f\u00a0is a suspenseful love AVG produced by Ku Xiaoshui. The game does not use AI art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u84dd\u6d77\u516d\u91cd\u594f is a visual novel with a storyline experience as its core. In this game, players will play as a man with two completely different fates, switching between the roles of a decadent unemployed young man and a hero who saves the world. They embark on a romantic and perilous adventure with six sweet and lovely women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After making different choices, the game will have a completely different ending.</p>","background":"https://sto